      "note": "Fiat Doblo 2016 owner handbook EN (manualslib 2151994): \"Diesel versions with DPF (1.3 MultiJet - 1.6 MultiJet - 2.0 MultiJet)\", printed pp. 176-177 (site pages 180-181); without-DPF table pp. 174-175"
